@host = http://localhost:5021
@token = paste-token-from-login

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "alice", "password": "password123" }

### Login
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userName": "alice", "password": "password123" }

### Create a text post
POST {{host}}/api/posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=b

--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Hello from Riga
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

First post!
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="mediaType"

Text
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="latitude"

56.9496
--b
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="longitude"

24.1052
--b--

### Media posts: get a capture ticket before capturing...
POST {{host}}/api/captures
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mediaType": "Image" }

### ...seal it with the file's SHA-256 right after, then send its id as "captureId" with the post
POST {{host}}/api/captures/paste-ticket-id/seal
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sha256": "paste-64-hex-chars" }

### Map points for the Baltics
GET {{host}}/api/posts/map?minLat=53&minLng=20&maxLat=60&maxLng=29&zoom=6

### Nearby
GET {{host}}/api/posts/nearby?lat=56.95&lng=24.1&radiusKm=50

### Feed (images and videos only)
GET {{host}}/api/posts/feed?types=Image&types=Video
